### Add consultation slot (doctor only)
### Run api/auth/login.http first — the jwt variable is captured automatically.
POST http://localhost:8030/consultation/add
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Cookie: jwt={{jwt}}

{
  "date": "2026-05-15",
  "startTime": "09:00:00",
  "duration": 30,
  "price": 200.00
}

